<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Per-carrier values captured from the stock build with the owner's SIM inserted
     (`dumpsys carrier_config`, section mConfigFromDefaultApp, carrier settings version
     s313390-360877900). Only standard AOSP CarrierConfigManager keys are carried over;
     Motorola-private keys (moto_*), Google Dialer keys and carrier device-management
     components that do not exist in this ROM are intentionally left out.

     Deliberate difference from stock: Wi-Fi calling is NOT offered in the first release
     (stock: available and on). Three signature permissions of the vendor CNE app cannot be
     granted without Motorola's platform key and there is no clean substitute for them
     (TELEPHONY_PORT.md section 4.1). To experiment on a userdebug build without rebuilding:
       adb shell cmd phone cc set-value -p carrier_wfc_ims_available_bool true
       adb shell cmd phone cc clear-values        (undo)

     Add further <carrier_config> blocks here for other SIMs, one per carrier, each backed by
     a dump taken on stock. -->
<carrier_config_list>
    <!-- Optimum Mobile (US), SIM MCC/MNC 313390 -->
